#           DOCX files generated by scripts/gen_demo_docs.py in runtime/demo-docs,
#           MySQL reachable via runtime/tools mysql.exe (password from infra/.env).
# Usage: powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File D:\dev\clm\scripts\seed-demo-data.ps1
